      "beat_id": "B02",
      "act": "EXHIBIT",
      "narration_text": "First, the post-hoc calibration bake-off. Right after fine-tuning, R L Trainer evaluates four candidate calibrators on the held-out calibration split: raw logits, temperature scaling, Platt vector scaling, and matrix scaling. Smooth log-space L-B F G S finds the optimum without hitting hard clamp boundaries, and saves the winner to calibrator dot p t.",
